{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"荃德花園疑電錶房故障　大堂一度停電\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-16-00-17-24r8Kxjf0X.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】荃德花園疑電錶房故障，大堂位置一度停電。</p><p>大堂位置漆黑一片，升降機無法運作，幾十名居民在大廈外等候，消防員到電錶房了解情況，亦有大批警員在場協助。</p><p>據現場消息稱，懷疑是電錶房故障，大堂等公眾地方停電，樓上住宅單位供電沒受影響。中電派出工程車到場，表示供電設備及供電正常。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:45:12.953459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:12:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T20:49:42.331142+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T16:38:13.105153+00:00","content_hash":"27bd6b272780463175034e5d1acb70d85e259a3f3ed37208e3c1766a7f59a829","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:45:12.953459+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}